  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Mental Health in Low Income Countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To generate evidence on the implementation and scaling up of integrated packages of care for priority mental disorders in primary and maternal health care contexts. Includes generating evidence that helps to get mental health better reflected in annual operational plans at the district and national level.</narrative>
  </description>
